    "body": "> Should this also be added to https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-5/ then? Otherwise you would not be able to use the same values without conversion in `fillStyle` and the like, right?\n\nIt is [in CSS Color HDR](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-hdr/#valdef-color-rec2100-linear) which was [adopted by CSS WG resolution in 2023](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/553#issuecomment-1864865513)\n\nIt was also [added to color.js in 2024](https://github.com/color-js/color.js/issues/443) so you can [use it in the color calculator](https://apps.colorjs.io/convert/?color=color(rec2100-linear%200.3%200.7%200.1)&precision=4) eg for creating tests.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
