    "body": "> Discussing this with colleagues we'd be more supportive of this if we could add `display-srgb-linear` \n\nIs that a copy-paste error? Should it be [`srgb-linear`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#predefined-sRGB-linear)\n\nI agree it would be useful for Canvas.\n\n> and `display-p3-linear` (the latter does not seem to be in CSS at this time, not sure why) at the same time.\n\nFeel free to raise a csswg issue about that, preferably with a brief explanation of why it is needed (aligns with hardware? fits an Apple API?)\n\n",
