    "updated_at": "2025-08-07T23:45:13Z",
    "body": "I'm also fine with `srgb-linear`. I do want to clarify that it will be have like [`kCGColorSpaceExtendedLinearSRGB`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/coregraphics/cgcolorspace/extendedlinearsrgb?language=objc) and not [`DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G10_NONE_P709`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/dxgicommon/ne-dxgicommon-dxgi_color_space_type). That is, the backbuffer value `[1,1,1]` shall be the same color as `white` (modulo tone mapping), not some independent separate thing.\n\nHow about we do those two, and then consider `display-p3-linear` as it makes its way through CSSWG etc?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3166147780/reactions",
