    "updated_at": "2025-08-08T20:10:44Z",
    "body": "> Sounds like a plan. [@ccameron-chromium](https://github.com/ccameron-chromium) I assume since you proposed it that there is Chromium implementer interest, could you confirm?\n\nYes, confirm! (interest in `rec2100-linear` and `srgb-linear`, not-opposed to `display-p3-linear` and perfectly willing to add it if desired elsewhere)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
