    "body": "> I filed [w3c/csswg-drafts#12596](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12596).\n\nCSSWG discussed adding `display-p3-linear` yesterday and agreed to add it. The [spec is updated](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#predefined-display-p3-linear) and I have a [PR for some WPT](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/54425).",
