    "updated_at": "2025-09-08T14:02:21Z",
    "body": "@annevk\n> If it's not too much trouble we'd much prefer adding them all at once.\n\n - [`srgb-linear`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#predefined-sRGB-linear) is in CSS Color 4\n - [`display-p3-linear`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#predefined-display-p3-linear) is now in CSS Color 4 too (and [tested in WPT](https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-color?label=master&label=experimental&aligned&q=display-p3-linear))\n - [`rec2100-linear`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-hdr/#valdef-color-rec2100-linear) is in CSS Color HDR\n\nanything else needed to move forward on this?\n\n",
